1
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:06,070
Children's Law

2
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:13,570
Article 15. Right to care and nurturing

3
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:23,200
Children have the right to be cared for and nurtured to develop comprehensively.

4
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:38,050
Article 16. Right to education, learning and talent development

5
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:53,200
1. Children have the right to education, learning to develop comprehensively and best promote their own potential.

6
00:00:53,200 --> 00:01:00,220
2. Children are equal in learning and education opportunities;

7
00:01:00,220 --> 00:01:11,320
talents, aptitudes, creativity, inventions are developed.

8
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:20,370
Article 17. Right to play and recreation

9
00:01:20,370 --> 00:01:26,270
Children have the right to play and recreation;

10
00:01:26,270 --> 00:01:42,050
equal opportunities to participate in cultural, arts, physical education, sports, tourism activities suitable for age.

